---@field connectResources? gcp.unstable.gkehub_v1.ResourceManifestList Output only. The Kubernetes resources for installing the GKE Connect agent This field is only populated in the Membership returned from a successful long-running operation from CreateMembership or UpdateMembership. It is not populated during normal GetMembership or ListMemberships requests. To get the resource manifest after the initial registration, the caller should make a UpdateMembership call with an empty field mask.
---@field resourceOptions? gcp.unstable.gkehub_v1.ResourceOptions Optional. Options for Kubernetes resource generation.
---@field membershipResources? gcp.unstable.gkehub_v1.ResourceManifestList Output only. Additional Kubernetes resources that need to be applied to the cluster after Membership creation, and after every update. This field is only populated in the Membership returned from a successful long-running operation from CreateMembership or UpdateMembership. It is not populated during normal GetMembership or ListMemberships requests. To get the resource manifest after the initial registration, the caller should make a UpdateMembership call with an empty field mask.

